Package: konaro-glass
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ${kwin:Depends}
Description: Liquid Glass effect for KWin (Konaro OS)
 Blur with refraction at the edges ("Liquid Glass") for the KDE Plasma window
 manager, with rounded corners and saturation control. Based on the GPL-3
 "Better Blur"/"Glass" KWin effect, adapted by Konaro OS to KWin 6.3.
 .
 The effect uses KWin's private API, so this package is tied to the exact
 KWin version it was built against.
